<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-077-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.410313" lon="-120.883"><name>SC26-077-C</name><cmt>SC26-077</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 46/100; not catch probability. Center 46 ft; nearby 42–55 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-058</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41219404815622" lon="-120.88487749132115"/><trkpt lat="35.41201383485197" lon="-120.88488220235847"/><trkpt lat="35.41203311332184" lon="-120.88598287016823"/><trkpt lat="35.41158257971617" lon="-120.88599464146094"/><trkpt lat="35.41139658390876" lon="-120.88566915202159"/><trkpt lat="35.41058369587609" lon="-120.88558027796645"/><trkpt lat="35.41047816484674" lon="-120.88470211521056"/><trkpt lat="35.41074848483825" lon="-120.88469504843802"/><trkpt lat="35.41074269901003" lon="-120.88436485350032"/><trkpt lat="35.41010616588045" lon="-120.88405115278476"/><trkpt lat="35.409918235796994" lon="-120.88361561005797"/><trkpt lat="35.4091072762369" lon="-120.883636820257"/><trkpt lat="35.40911113472892" lon="-120.88385694565434"/><